OL,3,GNEWSAI'm burnt out and feel forgotten
OL,4,Aas a young carer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young carer says she feels burnt out,
OL,7,Fand forgotten about by friends as she
OL,8,Ftakes on extra tasks at home.
OL,10,FMadeline, 16, from Bridgend, cares for
OL,11,Fher mum and granddad, a role she says
OL,12,Fshe is happy to do.
OL,14,FBut she has said people do not always
OL,15,Funderstand its mental impact, and
OL,16,Fbelieves both formal and informal
OL,17,Fsupport is "crucial" to young people.
OL,19,FShe is one of an estimated 170,000
OL,20,Fyoung carers in the UK aged five to 17,
OL,21,Fbut the Carers Trust calls that number
OL,22,Fthe "tip of the iceberg".
